# The build target is an Android System WebView (minSdk 24), which auto-updates
# independently of the OS, plus the Codeberg Pages web build.
#
# The Ionic starter shipped a floor (Chrome 107 / Safari 16.1) below what
# Angular 22 supports, which made every build warn. These values are Angular's
# own supported range -- see https://angular.dev/reference/versions#browser-support
Chrome >=111
Firefox >=112
Edge >=111
Safari >=16.4
iOS >=16.4
